## Why This Is Asked

Tests the ability to apply PCA to heterogeneous data under strict on-device latency, ensuring interpretability for fraud alerts.

## Key Concepts

- Mixed-data PCA (PCAmix) or equivalent encoding
- On-device latency constraints and lightweight inference
- Imputation strategies for numeric and categorical features
- Global vs region-specific PCA implications
- Interpreting loadings to derive actionable fraud signals

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-code illustrating a PCAmix-like pipeline
const numericCols = [...];
const catCols = [...];
function preprocess(x){
  const n = medianImpute(x[numericCols]);
  const c = modeImpute(x[catCols]);
  const nScaled = scale(n);
  const cEncoded = oneHotEncode(c);
  return concat(nScaled, cEncoded);
}
const pca = new PCAMix({nComponents:6, global: true});
const z = pca.fitTransform(dataset.map(preprocess));
// Alert rule from top loading feature interpretations
```

