## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo: incremental PCA on streaming batches
const pca = new IncrementalPCA({nComponents:8});
for (const batch of stream) {
  const x = preprocess(batch); // impute, scale
  pca.partialFit(x);
  const scores = pca.transform(x);
  // use scores for anomaly scoring
}
```

